DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_CE4D_4BB5';
<p>ce4d_4bb5</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene A</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>artsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene A</span> has wings that are colorful and distinctive patterns.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene F</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>fuzzy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene F</span> is covered in a dense layer of hairs, giving it a soft appearance.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #9a3064;">Gene P</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #9a3064;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #9a3064;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, fuzzy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">9,894</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, fuzzy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">60,878</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">16,968</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,346</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,324</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">fuzzy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">f</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">17,134</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">60,630</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">9,826</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">180,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>F</b> and <b>P</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>F</b> and <b>P</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_CE4D_4BB5
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(2,324 + 2,346 + 9,826 + 16,968)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>31,464</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.1748 = <strong>17.48 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(2,324 + 2,346 + 9,826 + 60,630)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>75,126</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.4174 = <strong>41.74 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(2,324 + 2,346 + 9,826 + 9,894)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>24,390</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.1355 = <strong>13.55 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(2,346 + 9,894 + 17,134 + 60,878)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>90,252</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.5014 = <strong>50.14 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(60,630 + 60,878)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>121,508</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.6750 = <strong>67.50 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(9,826 + 9,894 + 16,968 + 17,134)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>53,822</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.2990 = <strong>29.90 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(2,324 + 2,346 + 9,826 + 9,894)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>24,390</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.1355 = <strong>13.55 cM</strong>
LITERAL_CE4D_4BB5_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
